The files named `toml*` are the manifests of the published crates toml 1.1.4, toml_parser 1.1.3, toml_edit 0.23.10, toml_datetime 1.1.1 and toml_writer 1.1.2
(the `Cargo.toml.orig` of each), copied unchanged (MIT OR Apache-2.0). The files named `ryo_*`, `canonical_*` and `asymptote_*`, and `Cargo.lock` (the lock
file of ryo-next's workspace), are this repository's own.
